// via_forbidden_turn_len.mem -- 40 words x 48 bits (12 hex digits per line)
// viaForbiddenTurnLen, addr = z*4 + viaUp*2 + isDirY
//
//   [47:36]  lo0  12b  inclusive lower bound
//   [35:24]  hi0  12b  inclusive upper bound
//   [23:12]  lo1  12b  inclusive lower bound
//   [11:0]   hi1  12b  inclusive upper bound
//
//   forbidden when lo <= len <= hi in ANY of the 2 slots
//   unused slot = lo 0xfff, hi 0x000 -- unsatisfiable, so no valid bit is needed
//
// load with $readmemh
